WEBVTT

00:14:28.223 --> 00:14:32.262
entities that exist only
in our own imagination.

00:14:32.929 --> 00:14:34.081
Thank you.

00:14:34.105 --> 00:14:38.676
(Applause)

00:14:44.299 --> 00:14:46.509
Bruno Giussani: Yuval, you have
a new book out.

00:14:46.533 --> 00:14:48.336
After Sapiens, you wrote another one,

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.947
and it's out in Hebrew, but not
yet translated into ...

00:14:50.971 --> 00:14:53.900
Yuval Noah Harari: I'm working on
the translation as we speak.

00:14:53.924 --> 00:14:56.092
BG: In the book, if I
understand it correctly,

00:14:56.116 --> 00:15:01.745
you argue that the amazing breakthroughs
that we are experiencing right now